{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38567","headline":"偶书 · 吴融","name":"偶书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青牛关畔寄孤村，山当屏风石当门。\n芳树绿阴连蔽芾，长河飞浪接崑仑。\n苔田绿後蛙争聚，麦壠黄时雀更喧。\n只此无心便无事，避人何必武陵源。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}